BUY requires
1. Confirmed LOW pivot
2. Previous structure = bullish
3. Current pivot is a Higher Low
4. Fast bullish direction
5. Bullish reversal candle
6. Close above pivot candle high
7. Meaningful bullish structure break
8. Entry ≤ 5 pips from pivot
9. Entry extension ≤ 2 pips

SELL requires
1. Confirmed HIGH pivot
2. Previous structure = bearish
3. Current pivot is a Lower High
4. Fast bearish direction
5. Bearish reversal candle
6. Close below pivot candle low
7. Meaningful bearish structure break
8. Entry ≤ 5 pips from pivot
9. Entry extension ≤ 2 pips

